  "binding": "Original status custom action -> step-scoped occurrence receipt -> existing native graph clock -> CharacterDamageUIManager",
  "operation": "Record each local cooldown invocation and in-step immunity refusal at its existing presentation clock, retaining the owning cast until approach/replay/trigger offsets are finalized. Prefer an unambiguous direct damage association; otherwise use an explicitly recorded finite occurrence delay. Keep old pending counters and receipts without timing evidence on the existing compatible path. No gameplay cooldown arithmetic, RNG, status acceptance, source prefab, animation, material or texture is changed."
}
